+ *  This header file must define the following set of macros:
+ *
+ *    GWS_LOG_DEBUG(...)
+ *    GWS_LOG_VERBOSE(...)
+ *    GWS_LOG_INFO(...)
+ *    GWS_LOG_WARNING(...)
+ *    GWS_LOG_ERROR(...)
+ *    GWS_LOG_EXCEPTION(__EXCEPTION__)
+ *
